CaesiumOS
===========

Getting started
---------------

To get started with Android/CaesiumOS, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

To initialize your local repository using the CaesiumOS trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/CaesiumOS/manifest.git -b caesium-3.5-beta --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```
Building instructions to be added soon.


Submitting patches
------------------
Patches are always welcome! Please submit your patches via pull requests to individual repositories.
Gerrit may be set up in the future!
